        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exit Denied</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game set inside a decaying mental asylum where something unnatural stalks the halls. You're trapped, weaponless, and constantly hunted by the <strong>Morph</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you’ll need to <strong>search the facility</strong>, gather hidden components, and <strong>build a weapon from scratch</strong>. But the Morph won't wait. It adapts. It listens. It <strong>knows</strong> you're trying to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the weapon is ready, <strong>the final confrontation begins</strong>. You’ll have only one chance. And one shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short sessions, maximum tension:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Exit Denied</i> is designed for compact play sessions – perfect for quick adrenaline rushes or spontaneous horror rounds in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer’s Note:</strong> <i>“Exit Denied” is my first released game. I’m using this project to gain experience in game development.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exit Denied</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game set inside a decaying mental asylum where something unnatural stalks the halls. You're trapped, weaponless, and constantly hunted by the <strong>Morph</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you’ll need to <strong>search the facility</strong>, gather hidden components, and <strong>build a weapon from scratch</strong>. But the Morph won't wait. It adapts. It listens. It <strong>knows</strong> you're trying to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the weapon is ready, <strong>the final confrontation begins</strong>. You’ll have only one chance. And one shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short sessions, maximum tension:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Exit Denied</i> is designed for compact play sessions – perfect for quick adrenaline rushes or spontaneous horror rounds in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer’s Note:</strong> <i>“Exit Denied” is my first released game. I’m using this project to gain experience in game development.</i></p>",
        "short_description": "Exit Denied is a first-person psychological horror game set in an abandoned asylum. Hunted by a shifting entity known as Morph, you must search for parts, build a weapon, and survive long enough to escape. But Morph won’t wait—and it doesn’t let anyone leave.",
